          "baodiPractice": "准确率 ＝(TP＋TN)/(TP＋TN＋FP＋FN)＝(80＋80)/200 ＝ 80%\n精确率 ＝TP/(TP＋FP)＝80/(80＋20)＝ 80%\n召回率 ＝TP/(TP＋FN)＝80/(80＋20)＝ 80%\nF1 ＝2×P×R/(P＋R)＝2×0.8×0.8/(0.8＋0.8)＝ 0.8，即 80%",
